{"c":[{"name":"20261023T001340Z-ee4e725d1cf8c7b2","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: any explicit storage_compatibility_version (even 'latest') makes a plain connect to the same path in the same process raise ConnectionException. A v1.0.0 file opened with 'v2.0.0' keeps v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 still reads and writes it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001341Z-996aef6d584dc9d1","text":"Live tables copied 2026-10-22 into v2.0.0 files: plain 489 MiB (text Uncompressed), zstd on text+tool_input 290 MiB. ILIKE over text 142 vs 196 ms, sum(length(text)) 27 vs 97 ms, latest 50 rows 3 ms both. Copy 5.3 s both.","type":"note"}]}
